  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Alice initially has a string SSS of length NNN, and she decides to modify it! Her modification consists of KKK steps numbered from 111 to KKK. In the iii-th step, Alice reverses the prefix of length iii of SSS.\n\nFor example, suppose Alice starts with S=abfertyS = \\texttt{abferty}S=abferty, and she modifies it via 333 steps, then:\n\n\nAfter the first step, abferty→S=abferty\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{a}}\\texttt{bferty} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{abferty}abferty→S=abferty\nAfter the second step, abferty→S=baferty\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{ab}}\\texttt{ferty} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{baferty}abferty→S=baferty\nAfter the third step, baferty→S=faberty\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{baf}}\\texttt{erty} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{faberty}baferty→S=faberty\nSo after 333 steps, her string becomes S=fabertyS = \\texttt{faberty}S=faberty.\nAfter performing her KKK-step modification, Alice ends up with the string S′S'S′. Now she challenges you to find the **original** string SSS. Can you do it?\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of the input contains a single integer TTT - the number of test cases. The test cases then follow.\nThe first line of the test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and KKK - the length of the string and the number of steps in Alice's modification.\nThe second line of the test case contains S′S'S′ - the final string obtained after the modification.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the **original** string SSS.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤10001 \\leq T \\leq 10001≤T≤1000",
      "1≤N≤1061 \\leq N \\leq 10^61≤N≤106",
      "1≤K≤N1 \\leq K \\leq N1≤K≤N",
      "∣S′∣=N|S'| = N∣S′∣=N",
      "S′S'S′ contains only lowercase alphabets",
      "Sum of NNN overall cases does not exceed 10610^6106.",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 111 (30 points)**: 1≤N⋅K≤20001 \\leq N \\cdot K \\leq 20001≤N⋅K≤2000",
      "**Subtask 222 (70 points)**: Original constraints"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n7 3\nfaberty\n7 5\nbbaaaba\n4 4\nzxwy",
        "output": "abferty\naababba\nwxyz",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 222: The modification steps from SSS to S′S'S′ is as follow:\n\n111-st step: aababba→S=aababba\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{a}}\\texttt{ababba} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{aababba}aababba→S=aababba\n222-nd step: aababba→S=aababba\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{aa}}\\texttt{babba} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{aababba}aababba→S=aababba\n333-rd step: aababba→S=baaabba\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{aab}}\\texttt{abba} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{baaabba}aababba→S=baaabba\n444-th step: baaabba→S=aaabbba\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{baaa}}\\texttt{bba} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{aaabbba}baaabba→S=aaabbba\n555-th step: aaabbba→S=bbaaaba\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{aaabb}}\\texttt{ba} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{bbaaaba}aaabbba→S=bbaaaba\n\n\nTest case 333: The modification steps from SSS to S′S'S′ is as follow:\n\n111-st step: wxyz→S=wxyz\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{w}}\\texttt{xyz} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{wxyz}wxyz→S=wxyz\n222-nd step: wxyz→S=xwyz\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{wx}}\\texttt{yz} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{xwyz}wxyz→S=xwyz\n333-rd step: xwyz→S=ywxz\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{xwy}}\\texttt{z} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{ywxz}xwyz→S=ywxz\n444-th step: ywxz→S=zxwy\\textcolor{blue}{\\texttt{ywxz}} \\rightarrow S = \\texttt{zxwy}ywxz→S=zxwy"
      }
    ]
